    "rating": 5,
    "reference": "ChIJa-3b8Ms3yUwRtX3qMpyXwVg",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Robert Turcotte",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103618150346432525681/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJD7X9c1EjuCU5IWIVGsxkV68GXQaooSbqnXJqdy-EEctTZxQQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Kanreikai Karate Vaudreuil is a fantastic dojo that stays true to the traditions of karate - discipline, respect, and self-improvement. My son and I truly appreciate the supportive community and passionate instructors. It’s more than just martial arts; it’s a place to grow together, both physically and mentally.",
        "time": 1747871213,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nitin Patel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110783085100951896356/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrLtuw69XOi75cQQ34tgiZdQHF-soJtbMnzgUwQIUaxMUHQHAO6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I cannot recommend Kanreikai Karate Vaudreuil highly enough! My children’s experience here has been nothing short of exceptional. Sensei Michael and Senpai Ruth are incredibly skilled, patient, and dedicated to helping every student reach their full potential.  They not only teach the art of karate but also instill important values like discipline, respect, and perseverance. They create a supportive environment where everyone feels motivated to push themselves and grow, both physically and mentally.\nWhether you're a complete beginner or have been practicing for years, Kanreikai Karate Vaudreuil is the perfect place to train. The classes are well-structured and cater to students of all ages and skill levels. Plus, the sense of camaraderie among fellow students adds to the overall positive atmosphere.\n\nIf you're looking for a karate dojo with exceptional instructors, look no further than Kanreikai Karate Vaudreuil!",
        "time": 1713906819,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Viorela Andone",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110706821320613710966/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDyXor35_3sqQeuJTqSOkXFfiDXc1tIxAXYpY5ppon84xXKQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We strongly recommend Kanreikai Karate Vaudreuil! Sensei Mike and senpai Ruth are  amazing with both our children. They teach them confidence, stability and how to perform with high standards. As parents we joined the classes along our children and we get to spend very valuable family time together while learning more about karate.",
        "time": 1717119472,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brianne R",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110254604008822646779/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1_lA3OFwZOG-KVXGJbRgNNSTMIJdcCqHh6w89vySbYnQBb467=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "As a mom of 2 young boys; finding myself as a karate student mid-life never would have occurred to me; but Sensei Mick and Senpai Ruth are two of the most patient, incredible teachers you could ask for.  While maintaining a traditional Japanese approach adapted  with modern techniques they create an environment that is welcoming to all students regardless of age, gender or previous skillset.  The sense of community amongst other students that exists here is second to none and has become our 2nd family.",
        "time": 1708303178,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Debby L",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101949715084654139546/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxL-hDcLpTHjWDWlJwS76IrqBh3vAp5DjHv6zpCjtBP74m-w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Sensei Michael and Ruth are amazing and great with kids of all ages. They are engaging and often use humor to teach certain techniques. They also take the time to explain things and they always make you feel like you're trying your best! My son and his friend absolutely love it! Thank you! Highly recommend !",
        "time": 1641863820,
        "translated": false
      }
